	BT 84  778 Td 0 Tr (The phrase, "Hello, World", in the context of programing, is most popularly)Tj ET
	BT 42  768 Td 0 Tr (taken from a book: "The C Programming Language" by &Brian W. Kernighan and)Tj ET
	BT 42  758 Td 0 Tr (&Dennis M. Ritche. [1, pp. 9-12,37,83,87,95,126])Tj ET

