	BT 84  668 Td 0 Tr (It was, however, not the first occurence of the phrase being used in the)Tj ET
	BT 42  658 Td 0 Tr (context of a programing example. In relation to the authors, the first use was)Tj ET
	BT 42  648 Td 0 Tr (actually in a Bell Laboratories Computing Science Technical Report in 1973, compared)Tj ET
